    title: "Why Menstrual Healthcare for Intersex People Matters",
    text: "When we talk about menstrual health, many people only think of female persons. But not everyone who menstruates is a female person. Some intersex people also menstruate. Their needs are often ignored in health programmes and public conversations.",
