    text: "Violence against women and girls is one of the world’s oldest evil. The United Nations estimates that 1 in 3 women experience one form of violence or the other in their lifetime; this is estimated 736 million women worldwide, making violence against women and girls a global pandemic.",
    description:
      "Explore the impact of stigma on gender-based violence, the culture of silence, and victim-blaming. Learn how to empower survivors and foster accountability",
